# This file is part of the postfix-sqlite package.
# It defines how Postfix loads the SQLite transport plugin.
# The format is: <library_path>:<load_method>:<owner>:<group>:<permissions>
#
# - library_path: The path to the .so file provided by the postfix-sqlite package.
# - load_method: 'f' indicates the file is loaded dynamically by Postfix.
# - owner/group: Standard system user/group for the library file.
# - permissions: 755 ensures the file is executable by all but writable only by root.
#
# This configuration does not require external database credentials or host connections.
# It merely registers the plugin with the Postfix master daemon.

$postfix_shlib_directory/postfix-sqlite.so:f:root:root:755
